#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:202
msgid ""
"Subscribe form submissions to a Newsman list. The selected email field is "
"used as the subscriber email; the chosen properties are pushed as Newsman "
"subscriber properties."
msgstr ""
"Aboneaza trimiterile formularului la o lista Newsman. Campul de email "
"selectat este folosit ca email al abonatului; proprietatile alese sunt "
"impinse ca proprietati de abonat Newsman."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:208
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:236
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:355
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:81
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:284
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:214
msgid "Send to Newsman"
msgstr "Trimite la Newsman"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:219
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:216
msgid ""
"When enabled, every successful submission of this form is subscribed to the "
"selected Newsman list."
msgstr ""
"Cand este activat, fiecare trimitere reusita a acestui formular este abonata"
" la lista Newsman selectata."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:225
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:246
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:104
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:225
msgid "Newsletter form"
msgstr "Formular newsletter"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:236
msgid ""
"When enabled, submissions are routed to the Newsman list and segment "
"configured in Newsman - Sync (the per-form Newsman list and Segment rows "
"below are hidden because they no longer apply)."
msgstr ""
"Când este activat, trimiterile sunt direcționate către lista și segmentul "
"Newsman configurate în Newsman - Sync (rândurile Listă și Segment Newsman "
"per formular de mai jos sunt ascunse deoarece nu se mai aplică)."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:242
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:245
msgid "Newsman list"
msgstr "Lista Newsman"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:247
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:237
msgid ""
"No Newsman lists are available. Configure your Newsman API key on the "
"Newsman settings page first."
msgstr ""
"Nu sunt disponibile liste Newsman. Configurati mai intai cheia API Newsman "
"pe pagina de setari Newsman."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:251
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:140
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:172
msgid "— select a list —"
msgstr "— selectati o lista —"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:259
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:248
msgid ""
"List for this campaign-specific form. Ignored when \"Newsletter form\" is on"
" (the configured Sync list is used instead)."
msgstr ""
"Lista pentru acest formular specific campaniei. Ignorată când „Formular "
"newsletter” este activat (se folosește lista din Sync)."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:267
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:268
msgid "Newsman segment"
msgstr "Segment Newsman"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:271
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:348
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:374
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:400
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:497
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:160
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:531
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:254
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:374
msgid "— none —"
msgstr "— niciunul —"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:283
msgid ""
"Optional. Segments are list-scoped — only segments belonging to the selected"
" list above are kept. Changing the list resets the segment."
msgstr ""
"Opțional. Segmentele sunt specifice listei — doar segmentele care aparțin "
"listei selectate mai sus sunt păstrate. Schimbarea listei resetează "
"segmentul."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:297
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:295
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:208
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:323
msgid "Opt-in mode"
msgstr "Mod de opt-in"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:302
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:286
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:211
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:326
msgid "Single opt-in"
msgstr "Opt-in simplu"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:305
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:290
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:212
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:327
msgid "Double opt-in"
msgstr "Opt-in dublu"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:309
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:219
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:330
msgid ""
"Single opt-in subscribes the user immediately. Double opt-in sends a "
"confirmation email; the subscription is only completed once the user clicks "
"the link."
msgstr ""
"Opt-in-ul simplu abonează utilizatorul imediat. Opt-in-ul dublu trimite un "
"email de confirmare; abonarea este completată doar după ce utilizatorul dă "
"click pe link."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:315
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:366
msgid "Email field"
msgstr "Camp de email"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:320
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:343
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:369
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:395
msgid "Add a field to the form template to enable Newsman."
msgstr "Adaugati un camp in sablonul formularului pentru a activa Newsman."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:331
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:369
msgid ""
"The selected field provides the subscriber email. Any field type may be used"
" (text, tel, url, email, …)."
msgstr ""
"Campul selectat furnizeaza emailul abonatului. Orice tip de camp poate fi "
"folosit (text, tel, url, email, …)."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:338
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:384
msgid "Firstname field"
msgstr "Camp prenume"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:357
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:387
msgid ""
"Optional. When set, the field value is sent as the subscriber's firstname "
"instead of being included in the subscriber properties."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Cand este setat, valoarea campului este trimisa drept prenume al "
"abonatului in loc sa fie inclusa in proprietatile abonatului."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:364
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:396
msgid "Lastname field"
msgstr "Camp nume"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:383
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:399
msgid ""
"Optional. When set, the field value is sent as the subscriber's lastname "
"instead of being included in the subscriber properties."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Cand este setat, valoarea campului este trimisa drept nume al "
"abonatului in loc sa fie inclusa in proprietatile abonatului."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:390
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:408
msgid "Phone field"
msgstr "Câmp telefon"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:409
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:411
msgid ""
"Optional. When set, the field value is sent as the subscriber's phone under "
"the `phone` property key."
msgstr ""
"Opțional. Când este setat, valoarea câmpului este trimisă ca telefonul "
"abonatului sub cheia de proprietate `phone`."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:416
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:428
msgid "Send as properties"
msgstr "Trimite ca proprietati"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:421
msgid "Add a field to the form template first."
msgstr "Adaugati mai intai un camp in sablonul formularului."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:426
msgid "Send these fields to Newsman as subscriber properties"
msgstr "Trimite aceste campuri la Newsman ca proprietati de abonat"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:451
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:453
msgid "used as email"
msgstr "folosit ca email"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:453
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:455
msgid "used as firstname"
msgstr "folosit ca prenume"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:455
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:457
msgid "used as lastname"
msgstr "folosit ca nume"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:457
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:459
msgid "used as phone"
msgstr "folosit ca telefon"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:464
msgid ""
"Each checked field is sent to Newsman as a subscriber property keyed by its "
"form-tag name."
msgstr ""
"Fiecare camp bifat este trimis la Newsman ca proprietate de abonat, avand ca"
" cheie numele form-tag-ului."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formprocessor.php:83
msgid ""
"Newsman: CF7 form is marked as newsletter form but no list is configured in "
"Newsman - Sync."
msgstr ""
"Newsman: formularul CF7 este marcat ca formular newsletter, dar nicio listă "
"nu este configurată în Newsman - Sync."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formprocessor.php:90
msgid "Newsman: CF7 form is enabled but no list is selected."
msgstr ""
"Newsman: formularul CF7 este activat, dar nu este selectata nicio lista."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formprocessor.php:100
msgid "Newsman: CF7 form has no email field configured."
msgstr "Newsman: formularul CF7 nu are configurat un camp de email."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formprocessor.php:117
msgid "Newsman: CF7 email field is empty."
msgstr "Newsman: campul de email al formularului CF7 este gol."

#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:247
msgid ""
"When on, the form uses the list and segment configured in Newsman - Sync; "
"the per-form Newsman List and Newsman Segment values below are stored but "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Când este activ, formularul folosește lista și segmentul configurate în "
"Newsman - Sync; valorile Listă Newsman și Segment Newsman per formular de "
"mai jos sunt salvate dar ignorate."

#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:258
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:127
msgid "Newsman List"
msgstr "Lista Newsman"

#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:259
msgid ""
"List for this campaign-specific form. Ignored when \"Newsletter form\" is on"
" (the Sync section list is used instead)."
msgstr ""
"Lista pentru acest formular specific campaniei. Ignorată când „Formular "
"newsletter” este activat (se folosește lista din secțiunea Sync)."

#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:272
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:170
msgid "Newsman Segment"
msgstr "Segment Newsman"

#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:273
msgid ""
"Optional. Segments are list-scoped — each option is labeled \"List name — "
"Segment name\". If the selected segment does not belong to the saved list, "
"it is dropped at submit time."
msgstr ""
"Opțional. Segmentele sunt specifice listei — fiecare opțiune este etichetată"
" „Nume listă — Nume segment”. Dacă segmentul selectat nu aparține listei "
"salvate, este eliminat la trimitere."

